### 1. Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes


### 2. Get one dish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/1


### 3. Get dishes for restaurant ID 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1


### 4. Create a dish successfully
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "name": "Special Firfir",
  "priceSantim": 20000
}


### 5. Reject a dish for a restaurant that does not exist
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 999,
  "name": "Invalid Restaurant Dish",
  "priceSantim": 15000
}